SUMMARY:Trivia Night at Southern Market - Meet People Lancaster team
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster PA Social Club\nDo you love trivia nights\, but want
  to avoid the hassle of trying to wrangle up enough friends to field a tea
 m? Come play for a Meet People Lancaster team and make some new friends al
 ong the way!\nCost: FREE\nBar & food stations are all walk up. You’ll be
  on your own tab for the night.\nHost: Elizabeth Chapman\nPlease try to ge
 t there by 6:30PM\, so we can get situated at a couple tables. Trivia star
 ts at 7PM. If you come early\, you’ll have time to mingle and get some f
 ood before trivia starts.\n\nLocation: 100 S Queen St\, Lancaster\, PA 176
 03\nHow to find the group: Our “usual” trivia spot is the tables in fr
 ont of Gloomy Rooster/Noodle King in the front left corner. We will also h
 ave a few yellow MPL signs!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meet-people-lancaster/events/31740377
 8/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261112T235913Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T235913Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
