SUMMARY:Board Game Night
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster PA Social Club\nChanging up our board game spot for 
 December.\nWe will provide plenty of games\, but feel free to bring your f
 avorite games as well.\n\nGreat first event opportunity if you haven’t m
 ade it out to one yet. Come on out and we’ll introduce you around!\n\nI
 ’ll come up early to snag a couple tables. Tables are first come\, first
  serve up here.\n\nWe’ll bring a bunch of games but you’re encouraged 
 to bring a couple of your favorites as well.\n\nCost: Free\, but please su
 pport our venue with food and drink purchases to thank them for hosting us
 \n\nHost: Jim Murray
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meet-people-lancaster/events/31759372
 7/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261126T144959Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261126T144959Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
